add(3,"Their bones turn up in caves, and still do.","baked","none (prop)","dim cave, firelit edge","push-in","NB19","Cave floor, clay bank, small bones, partly buried skull far from camera. Keep the skull small and partial: models mis-draw skull anatomy")
